# Tauri
src-tauri/target
# Cargo.lock is tracked: this ships a binary, so builds must be reproducible
# and the Rust crate versions must stay in lockstep with the npm @tauri-apps/*
# packages. Leaving it untracked let the two drift out of sync.
.claude
docs/
